{"name": "ELDRADOR\u00ae CREATURES SHADOWFALL", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"280\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932770/extras/efb9f16623b5b35d19823b2361cf9166.poster.avif?t=1753861642\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932770/extras/efb9f16623b5b35d19823b2361cf9166.webm?t=1753861642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932770/extras/efb9f16623b5b35d19823b2361cf9166.mp4?t=1753861642\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The adventure-filled worlds of Eldrador are in danger! Lead battle-ready creatures in turn-based strategic combat to defeat a mysterious shadowy menace.\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"64\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932770/extras/b95533cee83375af57bc02bb9f904cfc.avif?t=1753861642\" width=\"600\"/></span>What to expect:\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"280\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932770/extras/30b76aee385f4a600d8366ded402c967.poster.avif?t=1753861642\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932770/extras/30b76aee385f4a600d8366ded402c967.webm?t=1753861642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932770/extras/30b76aee385f4a600d8366ded402c967.mp4?t=1753861642\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 TACTICAL DEPTH: Freeze the opponent first? Push them into an obstacle? Or use your flame breath to roast multiple enemies at once? Use a range of accessible tactics to outsmart your opponent.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"64\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932770/extras/b95533cee83375af57bc02bb9f904cfc.avif?t=1753861642\" width=\"600\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"280\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932770/extras/aa332b245af35ad399dca3f5c66c3253.poster.avif?t=1753861642\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932770/extras/aa332b245af35ad399dca3f5c66c3253.webm?t=1753861642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932770/extras/aa332b245af35ad399dca3f5c66c3253.mp4?t=1753861642\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 GRIPPING BATTLES: Explosive attacks with spectacular effects make the meticulously crafted world of Eldrador quake.\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"64\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932770/extras/b95533cee83375af57bc02bb9f904cfc.avif?t=1753861642\" width=\"600\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"280\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932770/extras/822b34a80513339721f11707b0d7c19c.poster.avif?t=1753861642\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932770/extras/822b34a80513339721f11707b0d7c19c.webm?t=1753861642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932770/extras/822b34a80513339721f11707b0d7c19c.mp4?t=1753861642\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 FANTASTICAL WORLDS: Explore four diverse, open locations: the seething-hot Lava World, the dangerously cold Ice World, the indestructible Stone World and the overgrown Jungle World.\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"64\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932770/extras/b95533cee83375af57bc02bb9f904cfc.avif?t=1753861642\" width=\"600\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"280\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932770/extras/c26a954b9b4752f288be1a84e2a4d617.poster.avif?t=1753861642\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932770/extras/c26a954b9b4752f288be1a84e2a4d617.webm?t=1753861642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932770/extras/c26a954b9b4752f288be1a84e2a4d617.mp4?t=1753861642\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 HUMOROUS STORY: Join quirky characters through over 100 levels in a light-hearted tale brimming with charm and humour.\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"64\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932770/extras/b95533cee83375af57bc02bb9f904cfc.avif?t=1753861642\" width=\"600\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"280\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932770/extras/4184771ae501fbc58b90943d9f3d3446.poster.avif?t=1753861642\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932770/extras/4184771ae501fbc58b90943d9f3d3446.webm?t=1753861642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932770/extras/4184771ae501fbc58b90943d9f3d3446.mp4?t=1753861642\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 MIGHTY CREATURES: Assemble your favourite team of 20 creatures. Each creature has unique skills and grows stronger with every battle.\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"64\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932770/extras/b95533cee83375af57bc02bb9f904cfc.avif?t=1753861642\" width=\"600\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932770/extras/87ac67c56b6768f0f82207c546f2560c.avif?t=1753861642\" width=\"600\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 EASY TO LEARN, HARD TO MASTER: Easy for children and newcomers to the genre to pick up, while also offering a challenge to experienced gamers, thanks to the adjustable difficulty level.\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"64\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932770/extras/b95533cee83375af57bc02bb9f904cfc.avif?t=1753861642\" width=\"600\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932770/extras/313f95442a38a3c2ee5eff5637e7327a.avif?t=1753861642\" width=\"600\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 A FEAST FOR THE EARS: Fully voiced in English and German, with a thrilling soundtrack by Tim Grathwohl.\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"64\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932770/extras/b95533cee83375af57bc02bb9f904cfc.avif?t=1753861642\" width=\"600\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932770/extras/c0751585e7d16682b70be012305e124d.avif?t=1753861642\" width=\"600\"/></span>\u2022 \u2022 \u2022 MADE IN GERMANY: Based on the popular Eldrador\u00ae Creatures toys by schleich\u00ae.\u00a0  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"280\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932770/extras/4f54436076546d5ced5cfa7cb3ee9c46.avif?t=1753861642\" width=\"600\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 DIGITAL CREATURE GUIDE: No microtransactions, no additional DRM, no Season Pass - but there is a free, 21-page Creature Guide in PDF format as an extra.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What are you waiting for? Eldrador depends on you!</p> </div>", "short_desc": "The adventure-filled worlds of Eldrador are in danger! Lead battle-ready creatures in turn-based strategic combat to defeat a mysterious shadowy menace.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932770/header.jpg?t=1753861642", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Family Friendly", "Turn-Based Tactics", "Comedy", "Creature Collector", "3D", "Controller"], "developers": "Wild River Games GmbH", "publishers": "Wild River Games GmbH", "release_date": "Mar 5, 2025", "price": "$19.99", "appid": "2932770", "review_type": "Recommended", "curator_desc": "16 April 2025 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/JxY83knznM0", "first_seen": 1744754400.0, "review_rank": 1722}